{
  "被发现了！火力全开！": {
    "text": "We have been spotted. Weapons free.",
    "file": "./assets/voice/radio_01.wav",
    "duration": 2.073507180650038
  },
  "院子里的人被惊动了，小心！": {
    "text": "The compound is on alert. Stay sharp.",
    "file": "./assets/voice/radio_02.wav",
    "duration": 2.533068783068783
  },
  "夜视仪戴好，按 N 切换。跟紧我，保持安静。": {
    "text": "Night vision on. Press N to toggle. Stay close, and keep it quiet.",
    "file": "./assets/voice/radio_03.wav",
    "duration": 4.531273620559335
  },
  "情报显示前哨站在东边，大约四十米。武器已装消音器，尽量别惊动他们。": {
    "text": "The outpost is forty meters east. Suppressors are fitted. Keep this quiet.",
    "file": "./assets/voice/radio_04.wav",
    "duration": 4.833616780045351
  },
  "前哨站就在前面。塔楼上有个哨兵，先解决他。我们在这里掩护，你来决定开火时机。": {
    "text": "Outpost ahead. Sentry in the tower. Take him first. We will cover you. Fire when ready.",
    "file": "./assets/voice/radio_05.wav",
    "duration": 5.7340325018896445
  },
  "前哨站已清除，干净利落。": {
    "text": "Outpost clear. Good work.",
    "file": "./assets/voice/radio_06.wav",
    "duration": 2.0251322751322753
  },
  "村子里还有武装分子，注意窗户和屋顶。": {
    "text": "Hostiles in the village. Watch the windows and rooftops.",
    "file": "./assets/voice/radio_07.wav",
    "duration": 3.5005668934240366
  },
  "这就是目标大院。「铁蝎」萨米尔就在主楼后侧房间里。": {
    "text": "This is the target compound. Samir is in the rear room of the main building.",
    "file": "./assets/voice/radio_08.wav",
    "duration": 4.419690098261527
  },
  "从正门突入，逐个房间清理。按 Q 投掷闪光弹。": {
    "text": "Breach the front entrance. Clear it room by room. Press Q for a flashbang.",
    "file": "./assets/voice/radio_09.wav",
    "duration": 4.6522108843537415
  },
  "目标确认击毙！快，搜查他的电脑，下载所有情报！": {
    "text": "Target confirmed down. Get to his computer. Download the intelligence.",
    "file": "./assets/voice/radio_10.wav",
    "duration": 4.2531179138322
  },
  "灯塔呼叫布雷克，侦测到大批敌方增援正向你们位置靠近，撤离机预计九十秒后抵达。": {
    "text": "Blake, this is Lighthouse. Enemy reinforcements are closing on your position. Extraction in ninety seconds.",
    "file": "./assets/voice/radio_11.wav",
    "duration": 6.357426303854875
  },
  "收到。所有人，坚守大院！弹药箱在庭院西南角，按 F 补给。": {
    "text": "Copy. All units, hold the compound. Ammunition is in the southwest corner. Press F to resupply.",
    "file": "./assets/voice/radio_12.wav",
    "duration": 6.493197278911565
  },
  "撤离机抵达，正在降落，东门已为你们打开！": {
